   1  Q.PFAM+F+R4    1.4938  Q.PFAM+F+R4{0.00646782,0.0328339,0.0544527,0.254796,0.390214,0.64231,0.548866,1.33963}
   2  3DI+G4         0.5062  3DI+G4{6.32729}

